    "mnemonic": "You know that <ja>麺</ja> means \"noodles\", and <ja>つゆ</ja> is another word for \"soup\" or \"broth\". Put the two together and you have the delicious <vocabulary>mentsuyu </vocabulary>, or <vocabulary>noodle soup base</vocabulary>. It's usually made of dashi, soy sauce, mirin and sugar​. Yum!",
